    "user": "U08EXEABDFX",
    "text": "Can we write to the `acceldev_context_on_device_config.status` for the purpose of marking the context as erronous? Should we mark context as erronous no matter the error? For instance, if invalid `fd` is passed to `ioctl_run` should that also cause the context to be marked?",
